During the 1970–71 Scottish football season, [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] competed in [[Scottish Division One]]. Celtic won the league to equal their 1905-1910 run of six-in-a-row, which was a Scottish record at the time. They also won the Scottish Cup for the 21st time, their fourth in seven seasons.

